# Signing material must never be committed. The key pair lives outside the repository
# (scripts/generate-signing-key.ps1 writes it to ~/.vfox-integrator-signing), so these lines are
# a backstop for the case where someone points the scripts at the working tree instead.
*.pem
*.crt
*.p12
*.jks
password.txt
